## 5. React Component Map & Architecture Boundary Check
Boundary rules verified against §2.1 and §2.2:
- Python Core Authority: Core is sole business authority. React component tree consumes read-only VM snapshots via 6 IPC domain channels and dispatches commands. No SQLite / filesystem / model calls in frontend.
- Single-direction Dependency: React Presentation -> Typed Contract -> Python Core. No business ViewModels recreated in React.
- State Layering: Server state (VM projections) vs UI state (hover/press, collapse, draft points, dirty input). Operations calling vm.*() strictly classified as commands.
- No Premature Lock-in: No premature locking of unverified React state libraries or IPC implementation details. Large binary policy adheres to file URIs.
Result: Architectural boundaries strictly respected.

